		{
			"id": "nOIBUWhXjhoaLIl_4",
			"text": "Typical Stats from the package record: ST 13, DX 11, IQ 10, HT 11, HP 13, WILL 10, PER 12, FP 11, SPEED 5.5, MOVE 5, DODGE 8, DR 0. GCS derives its own values by applying the ancestry; where the two differ, the package's Typical Stats are what the Dungeons on Automatic encounter tables use."
