			"id": "no3uEm0GQrCnAQIfI",
			"text": "Encounter rating: CER 18 (offense 14, protection 4), threat tier minor, appearing 6."
		},
		{
			"id": "n4cWIP86_YB0QU-Zi",
			"text": "Shortbow: Shortbow (11): 1d+1 impaling, Reach Ranged, 100. Loosed at anything running away. The damage is the bow's."
		},
