			"text": "Independent build total: 80 points of racial traits plus 22 points of racial skills."
		},
		{
			"id": "nXNkOuFIAILTjxVS7",
			"text": "Answers the SRD heading(s): Gnoll (SRD 5.1); Gnoll (SRD 3.5). Only the creature identity is taken from the SRD; the GURPS statistics, ratings and prose are this project's own work and reproduce no SRD text."
		},
		{
			"id": "nOa1BVW5VG6EXU7oZ",
			"text": "Typical Stats, damage and ratings are derived from the racial template, not authored beside it, so the sheet and the stat block cannot disagree."
		},
		{
			"id": "nDCQSqeCYHaigEl9t",
			"text": "Body mass used to scale this build: 110 kg. ST, Size Modifier and DR are checked against it; see the gurps-animal-sanity-check skill for the bands."
		},
		{
			"id": "nddFsN2Ige1E7UxH0",
			"text": "Movement: ground Move 5 (primary). The published Move is the primary medium's cruising Move; sprint figures are stated here and not folded into it."
		},
		{
			"id": "nT-rJQPsOgG4GRKwS",
			"text": "Treasure and grappling are not authored for this batch and ship as explicit nulls; `lair` carries a short habitat note, because where a wandering animal dens is an encounter fact rather than a loot one."
		},
		{
			"id": "nCR8-2LAUY1M1ShZA",
			"text": "About 2.1 m standing, which reads on the SM 0 row rather than the +1 row at 2.7 m."
		},
		{
			"id": "nExGTdShZ0fxF0gMo",
			"text": "ST 13 from Basic Lift: a gnoll carries a laden pack and a stolen goat across a day's open ground."
		},
		{
			"id": "n6_2Plazr9wlOXRcO",
			"text": "Discriminatory Smell with Tracking bought on top of it. The trait is the nose; the skill is what it does with a two-day-old trail, and a gnoll that had one without the other would not be the thing that follows a caravan for a week."
		},
		{
